00:12:50,940 --> 00:12:53,340
is that you classically get something called locked-in syndrome.

244
00:12:53,840 --> 00:12:57,740
This is when a patient's voluntary movements are completely paralyzed from head to toe.

245
00:12:58,000 --> 00:13:00,360
The only exception, classically, is the eyes.

246
00:13:00,360 --> 00:13:05,340
So that the only thing that the patient can move is the eyes, and that's why they call it locked-in syndrome.

247
00:13:05,680 --> 00:13:07,860
It's as if the patient is locked in their own body.

248
00:13:08,300 --> 00:13:09,740
